<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Resource a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Resource a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Physicians Resource Group Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set one-year target price of $25 a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 5/8 to 17-1/4 in late morning trade.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
